Rāma arms and leads Sugrīva and chiefs toward Kiṣkindhā --- Party views flowering trees rivers hills and ponds --- Party watches deer elephants and birds on road --- Rāma asks about cloud-like tree cluster --- Sugrīva describes seven sages austerities and heavenly ascent --- Sugrīva warns grove unassailable resonant with music and fire --- Rāma and Lakṣmaṇa bow and sight Kiṣkindhā